      "title": "Markdown Note by - jubied",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FLUX.2 Klein 9B KV — Image Edit Pipeline\n\n**Inputs:** 2 reference images + 1 text prompt → **Output:** edited image.\n\n## Required model files\n\nPlace each in the matching `ComfyUI/models/` subfolder:\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n\n```\nComfyUI/models/\n├── diffusion_models/  flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors\n├── text_encoders/     qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n└── vae/               flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## How to use (60 seconds)\n\n1. Update ComfyUI (`git pull` or Manager → Update All) — Klein nodes are recent.\n2. Drag this JSON onto the canvas.\n3. **Input group:** load two images.\n   - Top LoadImage = **Figure 1** (subject anchor).\n   - Bottom LoadImage = **Figure 2** (donor — outfit / style / scene / prop).\n4. **Prompt group:** paste your filled scaffold into the green node. See `master_prompt_template.md`.\n5. Click **Queue**. Output → `ComfyUI/output/flux2_klein/edit_*`.\n\n## Parameter notes (defaults are tuned for SPEED)\n\n- **CFG = 1.0** → negative prompt has NO EFFECT. The ConditioningZeroOut confirms this. Put all detail into the positive prompt.\n- **Steps = 4** → fast, soft on fine detail. Raise to **8–12** in Flux2Scheduler for portrait close-ups, fabric, hair, jewelry.\n- **Sampler = euler** → stable; leave it.\n- **Resolution** → inherits Figure 1's size after rescale. Crop Figure 1 deliberately.\n- **Seed** → randomized; switch to `fixed` once composition is right, then iterate the prompt.\n\n## Reporting issues\n\n- Workflow / runtime: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Templates: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
    {
      "id": 700,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        930,
