      ],
      "size": [
        450,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 23,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Master Prompt Scaffold (paste & fill below)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Universal scaffold\n\nFill each `{slot}` then paste into the green CLIP Text Encode node below. Skip rows that don't apply.\n\n```\n{SUBJECT — e.g. \"the woman in Figure 1\"}\n{TRANSFER — e.g. \"wearing the outfit from Figure 2\"}\n{ADDED — optional new elements}\n{SCENE — location, time, weather, lighting context}\n{PRESERVATION — face / pose / proportions / identity}\n{STYLE — camera, lens, lighting, medium, color grade}\n```\n\n**Reference syntax:** always say `Figure 1`, `Figure 2`, `Figure 3` — never \"the photo\" or \"the image\".\n\n**Avoid:** booru tags · vague verbs (\"improve\") · negative prompts (CFG=1 here means they do nothing).\n\nFull cheat sheet → `master_prompt_template.md`."
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    }
